  "summary": "A status message placed inside the content it is about: a form, a card, a panel. It sits in the flow at its container's width. Status sets the colour and glyph; Appearance sets how loud it is. Solid interrupts, for the one message on a view that must be seen now. Subtle informs, for context and guidance, and several can share a page.",
